04:56.920 --> 05:01.700
Exactly. So Flyxion is suggesting that the problem isn't that we haven't found the right brick.

05:01.940 --> 05:02.800
Oh, okay.

05:02.900 --> 05:05.440
The problem is the assumption that there are bricks at all.

05:05.600 --> 05:05.960
Wow.

05:06.340 --> 05:06.540
Yeah.

05:06.920 --> 05:10.000
If you strip away space-time geometry, if you strip away particles,

05:10.120 --> 05:11.900
