across different scales?

05:17.760 --> 05:21.660
From the microscopic quantum realm to the macroscopic cosmic realm.

05:21.920 --> 05:22.260
Right.

05:22.400 --> 05:26.760
What structures are mathematically mandatory just to prevent paradoxes?

05:26.880 --> 05:27.440
Precisely.

05:28.240 --> 05:30.560
We aren't building a universe out of matter.

05:31.200 --> 05:33.860
We are building it out of the necessity of consistency.

05:34.420 --> 05:34.660
Okay.

05:34.760 --> 05:38.060
So if local rules are going to stitch together to form a whole,

05:38.620 --> 05:41.400
certain mathematical behaviors are forced into existence.

05:41.400 --> 05:41.840
Yes.

05:42.720 --> 05:46.940
Flyxion is arguing that the fundamental forces, the particles, and gravity itself

05:46.940 --> 05:49.780
aren't physical objects placed into the universe.

05:50.040 --> 05:50.820
Wait, and what are they?

05:51.280 --> 05:56.600
They are the cosmic compensations, the necessary mathematical autocorrects required to cancel

05:56.600 --> 05:59.800
out errors when the universe tries to glue itself together.

05:59.920 --> 06:00.700
That is wild.

06:00.820 --> 06:02.980
Okay, so to see how that actually works mechanically,

06:03.160 --> 06:06.340
we need to look at the foundational ingredients Flyxion proposes.

06:06.520 --> 06:06.760
Right.

