07:34.420 --> 07:35.920
It's the raw potential.

07:36.200 --> 07:36.380
Yep.

07:36.420 --> 07:37.120
The raw energy.

07:37.120 --> 07:41.520
The vector transport, the V, is the actual physical network of pipes.

