07:55.060 --> 07:57.620
That actually works really well as a macroscopic analogy.

07:57.920 --> 08:01.100
The scalar field provides the raw potential energy.

08:01.220 --> 08:01.520
Okay.

08:01.680 --> 08:06.680
The vector field provides the directed structural pathways for that energy to move.

08:06.680 --> 08:07.280
The pipes.

08:07.660 --> 08:07.900
Right.

08:08.000 --> 08:13.920
